VALUES ('paper_001_v3_chunk_0021', 'paper_001_v3', 'paper_001_v3_sec_references', 21, 0, 10, 10, 'body_text', 'Martin Abadi, Andy Chu, Ian Goodfellow, H Brendan McMahan, Ilya Mironov, Kunal Talwar, and Li Zhang. Deep learning with differential privacy. In Proceedings of the 2016 ACM SIGSAC conference on computer and communications security , pp. 308–318, 2016.

