Figure 3: Shard re-training with TAFT (using sharding factor of 50) compared to the Paragon method of re-training the non-linear model from scratch. While both method guarantee complete unlearning, TAFT achieves close-to-paragon performance while speeding up unlearning by up to 50x.', 225, 882, 'high')
