VALUES ('paper_002_v1_chunk_0010', 'paper_002_v1', 'paper_002_v1_sec_3_2', 10, 0, 4, 5, 'body_text', 'Per the discussions in Section 3.1.3, since the idea that LLMs can self-correct their reasoning is not supported by the evidence so far, we turn our focus to the results in the intrinsic self-correction

