VALUES ('paper_004_v1_chunk_0054', 'paper_004_v1', 'paper_004_v1_sec_c', 54, 0, 27, 28, 'body_text', 'Proof of Theorem 1. ConsideraselectiveSSM(Algorithm2)with 𝑁 = 1, A = −1, B = 1,𝑠 = 𝖫𝗂𝗇𝖾𝖺𝗋(𝑥),𝜏 = 𝗌𝗈𝖿𝗍𝗉𝗅𝗎𝗌 . ∆ ∆ The corresponding continuous-time SSM (1) is

ℎ(𝑡) = −ℎ(𝑡) + 𝑥(𝑡)

which is also called a leaky integrator .

The discretization step size is

∆ = 𝜏 (𝖯𝖺𝗋𝖺𝗆𝖾𝗍𝖾𝗋 + 𝑠 (𝑥 )) 𝑡 ∆ ∆ 𝑡 = 𝗌𝗈𝖿𝗍𝗉𝗅𝗎𝗌(𝖯𝖺𝗋𝖺𝗆𝖾𝗍𝖾𝗋 + 𝖫𝗂𝗇𝖾𝖺𝗋(𝑥 )) 𝑡 = 𝗌𝗈𝖿𝗍𝗉𝗅𝗎𝗌(𝖫𝗂𝗇𝖾𝖺𝗋(𝑥 )) 𝑡

