VALUES ('paper_005_v5_chunk_0021', 'paper_005_v5', 'paper_005_v5_sec_references', 21, 1, 11, 11, 'body_text', 'Gail Weiss, Yoav Goldberg, and Eran Yahav. On the practical computational power of finite precision RNNs for language recognition. In ACL , July 2018.

