VALUES ('paper_005_v5_chunk_0024', 'paper_005_v5', 'paper_005_v5_sec_a_2', 24, 0, 12, 12, 'body_text', 'For each position 1 i n , the transformer embedding function represents token σ Σ and its i ≤ ≤ ∈ position i with a vector. Let V be an embedding matrix of size Σ m where each row represents the embedding for some σ . Let f : N D m be computable in time | | × O(log n ) . Then, → p e ( σ ,i ) = v + f ( i ) . i σ i', 107, 314, 'high')
