VALUES ('paper_005_v5_chunk_0025', 'paper_005_v5', 'paper_005_v5_sec_a_3', 25, 0, 12, 12, 'body_text', 'The two components of the self attention block are s , the similarity function, and v , the value function. Let h be the hidden state at the previouslayer and h ¯ = multi layer norm ( h ) . We define i i i similarity of keys and queries as follows:

q ⊤ k q = W h ¯ + b s ( h , h ) = exp i i , where i q i q . i j k = W h ¯ + b m/h ! i k i k Then the value function is defined v ( h p ) = W h ¯ + b . i h i h', 151, 408, 'high')
