VALUES ('paper_006_v3_chunk_0077', 'paper_006_v3', 'paper_006_v3_sec_h_3_5', 78, 0, 66, 68, 'body_text', 'Problemsinvolvingnumericcommonsensereasoningon M ATH V ISTA requirecommonsenseknowledge about daily objects and celebrities to answer visual questions. However, these problems present significant challenges to existing foundation models, including GPT-4V, as depicted in Figure 1. For instance, Multimodal Bard struggles to understand the optical illusion in an image (Figure 69) and to infer the age gap between two celebrities from another image (Figure 70). Figure 71 poses a question about the maximum volume a beaker can measure. However, GPT-4V lacks commonsense knowledge regarding the use of a beaker, resulting in an incorrect prediction.

