VALUES ('paper_006_v3_chunk_0088', 'paper_006_v3', 'paper_006_v3_sec_h_4_5', 89, 0, 81, 82, 'body_text', 'As evidenced by Figure 1, current models such as GPT-4V do not perform as well as humans in mathematical reasoning involving line plots. We speculate that the low performance is mainly due to the difficulty in detecting OCR text in the figures and accurately grounding the values, as illustrated by the examples in Figures 85 and 86. ID: 981 Question: What is the sum of 2002, 2003 and 2004? Ground truth: 70.4

