VALUES ('paper_006_v3_chunk_0090', 'paper_006_v3', 'paper_006_v3_sec_h_4_7', 91, 0, 85, 86, 'body_text', 'Math reasoning with puzzle text figures is challenging for current AI foundation models because interpreting these figures requires discerning underlying patterns from sets of shapes, as illustrated in Figure 89, and numbers, as in Figure 90. There is plenty of room for improvement.

