VALUES ('paper_007_openreview_2024_02_11_table_1', 'paper_007_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_007_openreview_2024_02_11_sec_4_1', 'table', 'Table 1', 'We report the results of training a 1.4B language model from scratch on Wikitext with intentional contamination. For each injected dataset, we report the number of examples used (size), how often the test set was injected into the pre-training data (dup count), and the p-value from the permutation test and sharded likelihood comparison test. The bolded p-values are below 0 . 05 and demonstrate in the case of higher duplication counts, such as datasets appearing 10 or more times,', 7, NULL, 'renders/paper_007/openreview_2024_02_11/page-0007.png', 'partial')
