VALUES ('paper_008_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0012', 'paper_008_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_008_openreview_2024_02_11_sec_4_1', 12, 1, 6, 6, 'body_text', 'When computing B OOOOK S CORE , we consider each sentence as a singular unit of confusion, rather than each of the questions associated with that sentence. GPT-4 hierarchical summary of Amy Harmon’s “A Girl Called Samson” A Girl Called Samson is a historical fiction novel set in the early 1800s, following the life of Deborah This is because both LLMs and human annotators Samson, a young girl orphaned and sent to live with Widow Thatcher. She is later indentured to a farmer until the age of eighteen, sparking What a is rebellion the within significance her to become of a soldier the and fight for her freedom. Living with the Thomas secret family as a costume servant, Deborah party? forms a ( close Salience bond with ) the youngest, occasionally ask multiple questions that essentially Jeremiah, and is encouraged by Reverend Conant to engage in correspondence with his niece, Elizabeth. As the American Revolution unfolds, Deborah becomes intrigued by the idea of independence and self-governance. Determined to pursue her dream, Ask questions Deborah disguises herself as target the same issue within a given sentence. 11 a man named Identify Robert Shurtli ff and enlists in the Fourth Massachusetts Regiment as a private. Throughout error her spans journey, she struggles to maintain her secret identity while facing the hardships of war and the contradictions of “…such fighting for freedom as narrowly while slavery avoiding still exists in the trouble colonies. She Thus, our metric intuitively measures the propor- impresses General Paterson with her skills and is eventually o ff ered the position of his aide-de-camp, providing her with better living conditions during and a opportunities. secret costume While working party…” closely with General Paterson and his aide, Agrippa Hull, Deborah continues to prove her worth a