VALUES ('assessment_ai_paper_009_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_009_openreview_2024_02_11', 'ai', 'model_run_codex_review_paper_009_openreview_2024_02_11', '0.5.0', 'iclr_inspired_due_diligence', '0.1-draft', 'approved', 'Deep neural networks (DNNs) trained for image denoising are able to generate high-quality samples with score-based reverse diffusion algorithms. These impressive capabilities seem to imply an escape from the curse of dimensionality, but recent reports of memorization of the training set raise the question of whether these networks are learning the "true" continuous density of the data.', 7.4, 'good', 'worth_reading_with_checks', 'medium', FALSE, 'report_ready', NULL, 'Codex 会话依据《Generalization in diffusion models arises from geometry-adaptive harmonic representations》锁定 PDF 中的可定位正文，对五个维度进行了独立暂定评估。总分 7.4/10 由五维等权计算；结论受论文自身实验范围、披露程度和未执行复现实验的限制。', '["正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：Deep neural networks (DNNs) trained for imagedenoising are able to generatehighquality samples with score-based reverse diffusion algorithms. ", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：G ENERALIZATION IN DIFFUSION MODELS ARISES FROM GEOMETRY - ADAPTIVE HARMONIC REPRESENTATIONS Zahra Kadkhodaie Florentin Guth Ctr. ", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：C.1 M ORE C α EXAMPLES Figure16: BF-CNNdenoiserstrainedon C α imagesofsize 40 × 40 achievenear-optimalperformance. "]'::jsonb, '["评分受以下论文内边界约束：C.1 M ORE C α EXAMPLES Figure16: BF-CNNdenoiserstrainedon C α imagesofsize 40 × 40 achievenear-optimalperformance. "]'::jsonb, '["How stable are the central findings under additional seeds, settings or datasets?", "Which conclusions remain valid outside the evaluated scope?"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

