Figure 4: Experiments with frozen GPT: left : Performance of frozen GPT-2 on the Conjunction task, center : Frozen GPT-2 model learns to perfectly implement the nearest neighbors algorithm, right : Illustration of attention patterns in GPT-2 while solving the Nearest Neighbor task.', 213, 739, 'high')
