Figure 20: Performance of Transformers on prompts with a permutation of teaching sequence examples and random examples. On Sparse Parities, the behaviour is the same as the vanilla case whereas for Conjunctions, the performance improves for prompts with 70 examples. The setting becomes closer to the vanilla case as the prompt length goes higher. See Section G.1 for more details.', 508, 2250, 'high')
