Weightingfunction λ p σ i q “ 1 λ p σ i q “ 1 σ i ` 1 ´ σ i s “ 2 ,s “ 150 ,µ “ 0 . 9 onCIFAR-10 s “ 10 ,s “ 1280 0 1 0 0 1 ? s “ 2 ,s “ 200 ,µ “ 0 . 95 onImageNet 64 ˆ 64 c “ 0 . 00054 d , d isdatadimensionality 0 1 0 Parameters P “ ´ 1 . 1 ,P “ 2 . 0 mean std k P 0 ,K ,where K isthetotaltrainingiterations (cid:74) (cid:75) σ “ p σ 1 { ρ ` i ´ 1 p σ 1 { ρ ´ σ 1 { ρ qq ρ ,where i P 1 ,N p k q ,ρ “ 7 ,σ “ 0 . 002 ,σ “ 80 i min N p k q´ 1 max min min max (cid:74) (cid:75)', 603, 1810, 'high')
