VALUES ('paper_012_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0023', 'paper_012_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_012_openreview_2024_02_11_sec_a', 26, 3, 15, 15, 'body_text', 'Now it becomes obvious from Eq. (13) that when θ ´ “ θ , we have ” ıˆ ˙ 1 σ σ lim ∇ L N p θ,θ ´ q “ lim 2 E min p θ ´ ξ q 1 ´ min N Ñ8 ∆ σ θ ∆ σ Ñ 0 σ 2 σ i ” i ıˆ ˙ σ σ “ 2 E min p θ ´ ξ q 1 ´ min σ 2 σ ” i ´ ¯ i ı d σ σ “ E min 1 ´ min p θ ´ ξ q 2 . d θ σ 2 σ i i Moreover, we can deduce from Eq. (13) that " 1 `8 , θ ą θ ´ lim ∇ L N p θ,θ ´ q “ , N Ñ8 ∆ σ θ ´8 , θ ă θ ´

