Figure 3: Compositional consistency regularization . In addition to the reconstruction objective, is minimized on recombined latents z ′ . Recombining slots of the inferred latents z ˆ of two ID cons L samples produces a latent z ′ , which can be rendered to an OOD sample x ′ due to the decoder f ˆ generalizing OOD. The encoder g ˆ is optimized to re-encode this sample to match z ′ .', 810, 3135, 'high')
