VALUES ('paper_013_ev_004', 'assessment_ai_paper_013_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_013_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0014', NULL, 7, NULL, 'text', 'paper_013_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0014', 'quote', 'This section first verifies our main theoretical result (Thm.3) on synthetic multi-object data (Sec.6.1). We then ablate the impact of each of our theoretical assumptions on compositional generalization using the object-centric model Slot Attention (Locatello et al., 2020a) (Sec.6.2).

