tion1 ########The1-thReasoningChainwithComments######## Belowisareasoningchaincontainingreasoningstepspresentedinorder: ———————————– Step1:ConvertthefractionsoftheskeinofyarnusedbyMariahandhergrandmaintoyards. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：ExperienceobtainedinIteration1 ########The1-thReasoningChainwithComments######## Belowisareasoningchaincontainingreasoningstepspresentedinorder: ———————————– Step1:ConvertthefractionsoftheskeinofyarnusedbyMariahandhergrandmaintoyards. "]'::jsonb, '["How stable are the central findings under additional seeds, settings or datasets?", "Which conclusions remain valid outside the evaluated scope?"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
