VALUES ('assessment_ai_paper_016_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_016_openreview_2024_02_11', 'ai', 'model_run_codex_review_paper_016_openreview_2024_02_11', '0.5.0', 'iclr_inspired_due_diligence', '0.1-draft', 'approved', 'Acquiring an accurate world model $\textit{online}$ for model-based reinforcement learning (MBRL) is challenging due to data nonstationarity, which typically causes catastrophic forgetting for neural networks (NNs). From the online learning perspective, a Follow-The-Leader (FTL) world model is desirable, which optimally fits all previous experiences at each round.', 7.2, 'good', 'worth_reading_with_checks', 'medium', FALSE, 'report_ready', NULL, 'Codex 会话依据《Locality Sensitive Sparse Encoding for Learning World Models Online》锁定 PDF 中的可定位正文，对五个维度进行了独立暂定评估。总分 7.2/10 由五维等权计算；结论受论文自身实验范围、披露程度和未执行复现实验的限制。', '["正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：Acquiring an accurate world model online for model-based reinforcement learning (MBRL) is challenging due to data nonstationarity, which typically causes catastrophic forgetting for neural networks (NNs). ", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：We provide more implementation details of Losse-FTL in this section. Referring to Figure 3, the input x is first pre-processed to be bounded between [ 3 , 3] , and then projected with a matrix t − 2 https://github.com/jannerm/mbpo containing values sampled from an isotropic Gaus…", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：In this section, we will showcase empirical results to validate the expressiveness of Losse (Section 4.1) and the online learning capability of Losse-FTL (Section 4.2), both in supervised learning settings."]'::jsonb, '["评分受以下论文内边界约束：Currently, we have not validated our method on problems with very high-dimensional state space such as Humanoid, or tasks with image observations. "]'::jsonb, '["How stable are the central findings under additional seeds, settings or datasets?", "Which conclusions remain valid outside the evaluated scope?"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

