VALUES ('paper_017_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0023', 'paper_017_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_017_openreview_2024_02_11_sec_references', 23, 3, 13, 13, 'body_text', 'Zhitao Ying, Jiaxuan You, Christopher Morris, Xiang Ren, Will Hamilton, and Jure Leskovec. Hierarchical graph representation learning with differentiable pooling. In S. Bengio, H. Wallach, H. Larochelle, K. Grauman, N. Cesa-Bianchi, and R. Garnett (eds.), Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems , volume 31. Curran Associates, Inc., 2018a.

