stop the training process. The maximum of epochs is set as 100 for each dataset. We saved the models with the best validation performance and evaluated them on the test set. We repeated all experiments 5 times with different random seeds, and the average performance metrics and their standard deviations are reported as the final performances. The proposed models are trained using the Adam optimizer (Kingma & Ba, 2014) with a fixed learning rate of 1 e − 4 and a weight decay rate of 1 e − 5 . To accommodate the varying model sizes across different datasets, we select the batch size from the set { 4 , 8 , 16 , 32 , 64 , 128 } . Notably, we choose the largest batch size that allows the model to be trained on a single GeForce RTX 2080 Ti GPU, ensuring efficient training.', 421, 1696, 'high')
