that arises is whether the improved performance of INSET can be solely attributed to the additional parameters introduced by this module, rather than the underlying framework itself. To address this concern and gain deeper insights, we conducted experiments using the CelebA dataset.

In order to enhance the capacity of EquiVSet and enable a fair comparison, we introduced an additional convolution layer within the InitLayer . By doing so, we ensured that both EquiVSet and INSET had comparable model sizes. The experimental results, including the performance of models with different model sizes, are reported in Table 9.

