et al., 2016). As shown in Table 5, VLAP with CLIP ViT-B/32 (Radford et al., 2021) and two LLMs (Zhang et al., 2022; Raffel et al., 2020) persistently outperform the previous methods, including MAGMA (Eichenberg et al., 2022), LiMBeR (Merullo et al., 2023), and FROMAGe (Koh et al., 2023). In addition, VLAP with BEiT (Bao et al., 2022) achieves comparable or better performance on several evaluation metrics than the previous approaches with CLIP image encoders, demonstrating the effectiveness of the proposed assignment prediction objective.', 777, 3355, 'high')
