VALUES ('paper_019_ev_004', 'assessment_ai_paper_019_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_019_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0005', NULL, 2, NULL, 'text', 'paper_019_openreview_2024_02_11_chunk_0005', 'quote', 'It is universally known that the best way to evaluate LLMs is human judgment, but collecting human annotations can be costly, time-consuming, and laborious (Ouyang et al., 2022; Zheng et al., 2023).

