Convergence . The Meta-Weight-Net paper (Appendix C) proves convergence of a general bi-level optimization formulation under specific assumptions – namely that the training and meta-loss are lipschitz smooth with bounded gradient. These conditions apply to our meta-loss as well, and the convergence guarantees also transfer.', 260, 1284, 'high')
