L F URTHER ANALYSIS FOR SELECTIVE CLASSIFICATION WITH OTHER ARCHITECTURES

We further analyze our method with the ViT-Small, Wide ResNet-28-10 (WRN-28-10) architectures for the classifier by replicating Tab. 2, comprising the area under accuracy rejection curve (AUARC) metric, from the main paper using them. Tab. 34, Tab. 35 denote the tables corresponding to these architectures respectively. The U-S CORE is same as the one used for Tab. 2. It can be observed that, upon going to these bigger architectures, there is either a minor improvement in performance gains or they remain same as Tab. 2. This further verifies the effectiveness of our method and advocates for its usefulness for various tasks requiring different kinds of neural network architectures.

