Table 1: L 2 Errors given by NEKM combined with convex splitting

L 2 absolute errors L 2 relative errors t = 0 . 005 1 . 961500 E − 03 2 . 679015 E − 03 t = 0 . 010 2 . 637368 E − 03 3 . 575214 E − 03 t = 0 . 015 3 . 043784 E − 03 4 . 097140 E − 03 t = 0 . 020 3 . 355984 E − 03 4 . 482861 E − 03 t = 0 . 025 3 . 626770 E − 03 4 . 803405 E − 03 t = 0 . 030 3 . 875158 E − 03 5 . 084055 E − 03 t = 0 . 035 4 . 109637 E − 03 5 . 335856 E − 03 t = 0 . 040 4 . 335455 E − 03 5 . 565334 E − 03 Figure 5: Value of energy functional. t = 0 . 045 4 . 557162 E − 03 5 . 777788 E − 03 This figure shows the value of energy t = 0 . 050 4 . 779471 E − 03 5 . 978301 E − 03 functional of two solutions.

