k approach against DRL learners, which can manipulate the victim to perform desired behaviors of human. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose BATTLE, a behavior-oriented adversarial attack approach against DRL learners, which can manipulate the victim to perform desired behaviors of human. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose BATTLE, a behavior-oriented adversarial attack approach against DRL learners, which can manipulate the victim to perform desired behaviors of human. "]'::jsonb, '["How stable are the central findings under additional seeds, settings or datasets?", "Which conclusions remain valid outside the evaluated scope?"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
