Vanilla Instruction-Tuned Reference 350M 1.2B 6.7B 175B Model Size Figure 4: Metric values for all metrics in the zero-shot setting for the GPT-3 model family for sampling temperature T = 1 . Results ordered by model size.', 382, 1494, 'high')
