VALUES ('assessment_ai_paper_030_openreview_2024_02_11', 'paper_030_openreview_2024_02_11', 'ai', 'model_run_codex_review_paper_030_openreview_2024_02_11', '0.5.0', 'iclr_inspired_due_diligence', '0.1-draft', 'approved', 'We present an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework designed to address the Flexible Job Shop Problem (FJSP). Our approach consists of two primary components: a generative model that produces problem solutions stepwise, and a secondary model that continually refines these (partial) solutions.', 5.4, 'adequate', 'selective_reading', 'medium', FALSE, 'report_ready', NULL, 'Codex 会话依据《SIMULTANEOUS GENERATION AND IMPROVEMENT: A UNIFIED RL PARADIGM FOR FJSP OPTIMIZATION》锁定 PDF 中的可定位正文，对五个维度进行了独立暂定评估。总分 5.4/10 由五维等权计算；结论受论文自身实验范围、披露程度和未执行复现实验的限制。', '["正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：We present an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework designed to address the Flexible Job Shop Problem (FJSP). ", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：S IMULTANEOUS G ENERATION AND I MPROVEMENT : A U NIFIED RL P ARADIGM FOR FJSP O PTIMIZATION Anonymous authors Paper under double-blind review", "正文可定位证据支持该维度判断：To evaluate the performance of the proposed framework,we performed it on both FJSP instance of random synthesis and publicly available FJSP benchmarks."]'::jsonb, '["评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework to solve the Flexible Job Shop Problem. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework to solve the Flexible Job Shop Problem. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework to solve the Flexible Job Shop Problem. ", "评分受以下论文内边界约束：In this paper, we propose an end-to-end reinforcement learning framework to solve the Flexible Job Shop Problem. "]'::jsonb, '["How stable are the central findings under additional seeds, settings or datasets?", "Which conclusions remain valid outside the evaluated scope?"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
