within the GUI layout. To contain error propagation, the recovery protocol first activated a rollback mechanism by clicking the back arrow (Index 1) to restore the baseline interface, followed by a precision-targeted secondary click using relative coordinates [N, 0.5, 0.8] within the Delegate button’s highlight region, successfully rectifying the initial localization inaccuracy. This case demonstrates LongHorizonUI’s operational efficacy and robustness in handling real-world automation exceptions.', 303, 1849, 'high')
