A PPENDIX

This appendix provides additional details for " TimeSliver : Symbolic-Linear Decomposition for Explainable Time Series Classification". Additional implementation details for TimeSliver and the backbone models are presented in Section B. Class distribution for the four datasets used in the interpretability study are provided in Section C. Detailed results on interpretability and predictive performance are given in Sections D and E, respectively.', 408, 2328, 'high')
