VALUES ('paper_035_ev_008', 'assessment_ai_paper_035_iclr_2026_proceedings', 'paper_035_iclr_2026_proceedings_chunk_0017', NULL, 9, NULL, 'text', 'paper_035_iclr_2026_proceedings_chunk_0017', 'quote', 'We report here a series of additional analyses investigating: (i) The contribution of the graph structure to CHARM ’s performance; (ii) The impact of the sparsification threshold τ to the computational efficiency and performance of CHARM ; (iii) The zero-shot cross-dataset transfer capabilities of CHARM and comparable approaches. Additional experimental studies are reported in Appendix C, including analyses on the impact of the activation layer choice (Appendix C.2) and on the generalisation performance CHARM on sequences of unseen length (Appendix C.3).

