Accuracy. Fixing the model to o4-mini, we compare the win rate of LLM priors against statistical baselines computed using N ∈ { 5 , 10 , 20 , 30 } data points sampled from the true distribution. This addressesthe question: “howmany datasamples isthe LLMprior worth?” We thenform LLMposteriorsbyupdating theLLMpriorwiththe same N examplesusedtocompute eachbaseline,andcompare

