Figure 6: Comparisons between π rollouts in the real-world and world model. Each trajectory 0 . 5 contains 20 interactions between π and Ctrl-World. Remarkably, both the generalist policy and 0 . 5 Ctrl-World transfer zero-shot to our new DROID setup.

