VALUES ('paper_043_iclr_2026_proceedings_chunk_0046', 'paper_043_iclr_2026_proceedings', 'paper_043_iclr_2026_proceedings_sec_i_1', 50, 0, 30, 30, 'body_text', 'Weprovideadditionalresultscomparingourframeworkwithbaselinesunderthefollowingfairnessnotions: Predictive Parity (PPV) (Chouldechova, 2017), p%-Rule (PRULE) (Zafar et al., 2017), Balance for Positive Class (BFP) (Kleinberg et al., 2016), and Balance for Negative Class (BFN) (Kleinberg et al., 2016). The dataset is Adult, using gender as the sensitive attribute. All other experimental settings are consistent with Table 1 in the paper.

