VALUES ('paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings_chunk_0037', 'paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings', 'paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings_sec_a_5', 50, 3, 27, 27, 'body_text', '(cid:110) (cid:112) (cid:111) Therefore, assuming that n ≥ 2ln(4 /δ )max 1 , √ 1 , 1 , KL( p ∥ p ) − 4 α and KL( p ∥ 2 ε ε α 1 2 1 (cid:18) (cid:113) (cid:19) p ) ≥ 4 α , and recalling we had assumed f ≥ n − Φ(2 (cid:112) 2KL( p ∥ p )) + 3 + ln(4 /δ ) , di- 2 1 1 2 2 2 n rect calculations show that it is sufficient to set: √ (cid:16) ε (cid:17) 1 / 4 f ≥ n − n n exp( − KL( p ∥ p )) (removal) , 1 1 2 16 π 1 2 √ (cid:18) KL( p ∥ p ) − 4 α (cid:19) 1 / 4 f ≥ n − n n 1 2 exp( − KL( p ∥ p )) (preservation) . 1 1 2 8 π 1 2', 199, 522, 'high')
