VALUES ('assessment_ai_paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings', 'paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings', 'ai', 'model_run_codex_review_paper_045_iclr_2026_proceedings', '0.5.0', 'iclr_inspired_due_diligence', '0.1-draft', 'approved', 'Machine learning systems increasingly face requirements to remove entire domains of information—such as toxic language or biases—rather than individual user data. This task presents a dilemma: full removal of the unwanted domain data is computationally expensive, while random partial removal is statistically inefficient. We find that a domain''s statistical influence is often concentrated in a small subset of its data samples, suggesting a path between ineffective partial removal and unnecessary complete removal. We formalize this as distributional unlearning: a framework to select a small subset that balances forgetting an unwanted distributi', 7.8, 'good', 'worth_reading_with_checks', 'medium', FALSE, 'report_ready', NULL, 'Codex 按锁定五维标准，仅依据《Distributional Machine Unlearning via Selective Data Removal》内部可定位证据完成评估；未使用录取结果或外部评审，也未声称复现实验。', '["研究问题与贡献陈述清楚：Machine learning systems increasingly face requirements to remove entire domains of information—such as toxic language or biases—rather than individual user data. This task presents a dilemma: full removal of the unwanted domain data is computationally expensi", "论文提供方法或实证支持：To assess how sensitive our selective deletion procedure is to the choice of feature representation, we conducted an ablation study on CIFAR–10 where we varied only the feature extractor and kept the selection algorithm and training setup fixed. We compare fiv"]'::jsonb, '["结论应限定在论文报告的设置内：Machine unlearning increasingly requires moving beyond individual record deletion to erase the influence of entire subpopulations. We tackled the central dilemma of this task: that full removal is computationally expensive, while naive partial removal is stati"]'::jsonb, '["核心结论在更多数据、模型或随机种子下是否稳定？", "未披露的实现细节是否会影响独立复现？"]'::jsonb, '["Paper-internal evidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
