vidence only.", "No experiment or code was executed.", "Originality is not an exhaustive prior-art search."]'::jsonb, '{"experiments_reproduced": false, "accept_reject_prediction_made": false, "external_reviews_used_for_scoring": false}'::jsonb)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

